# Keep host build artifacts and local cruft out of Docker build contexts.
# Critically, **/obj and **/bin must be excluded: their project.assets.json
# contains absolute paths to the HOST NuGet cache, which break `dotnet publish`
# inside the container (ResolvePackageAssets task failure).

**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store
src/EdgePulse.Dashboard/playwright-report
src/EdgePulse.Dashboard/test-results
